            "title": "About us",
            "description": "<p>We design, develop and manufacture magnetorheological actuators based on our scientific research. Our mission is to empower people trough greater human/machine interaction.<br /></p>\n<ul><li><br /></li>\n\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>By integrating our scientific expertise with our passion for innovation, we are committed to ensuring our customers' satisfaction through unrivalled collaboration, and to offering them unique opportunities to stand out in the marketplace thanks to our exceptional technology<br /></p>\n<ul><li><br /></li>\n\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>To achieve our goals and deliver on our commitments, Exonetik's approach is to :</strong><br /></p>\n<ul><li><br /></li></ul>\n<p>- Implementing rigorous, efficient and constantly improving quality management processes and systems.<br /><br />- Comply with all applicable laws and regulations.<br /><br />- Maintain a safe and healthy working environment for our employees.<br /><br />- Communicate openly and honestly with all our stakeholders, including employees, customers and suppliers.<br /><br /><br /></p>",
